stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> AUTHORIZING
    [*] --> VOIDED: void before any authorisation
    AUTHORIZING --> AUTHORIZED
    AUTHORIZING --> DECLINED
    AUTHORIZING --> UNKNOWN: no answer in time
    UNKNOWN --> AUTHORIZED: reconciled
    UNKNOWN --> DECLINED: provider never saw it
